{"h":["<div class=\"tk-inline\" data-side=\"abhinava\" data-label=\"अभिनवनारायणीया\"><span class=\"tk-ava\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_0\">अनुवृत्तस्यैव</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_1\">मृदादेः</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_2\">कारणत्वदर्शनात्</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_3\">अननुवृत्तस्य</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_4\">तन्त्वादेः</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_5\">घटादिकारणत्वादर्शनान्नैवमित्याह</span>—</span> <span class=\"tk-prat\" data-jb=\"5.1.11\" data-lemma=\"न त्वसद्वादिनामिति\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_6\">न</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_7\">त्वसद्वादिनामिति</span></span> <span class=\"tk-vy\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_8\">।</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_9\">असतः</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_10\">सदुत्पत्तिसम्भावनाहेतुभूतः</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_11\">अननुवृत्तस्य</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_12\">कारणत्वसाधको</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_13\">दृष्टान्तो</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_14\">नास्तीत्यर्थः</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_15\">।</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_16\">अनुवृत्तस्य</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_17\">कारणत्वे</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_18\">तु</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_19\">सोऽस्तीत्याह</span>-</span> <span class=\"tk-prat\" data-jb=\"5.1.11\" data-lemma=\"मृदिति\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_20\">मृदिति</span></span> <span class=\"tk-vy\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_21\">।</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_22\">स्यादेतदेवं</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_23\">यदि</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_24\">मृदः</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_25\">कारणत्वं</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_26\">तदेव</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_27\">तु</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_28\">कथमित्याशङ्क्य</span>, <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_29\">अन्वयव्यतिरेकौ</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_30\">दर्शयति</span></span> <span class=\"tk-prat\" data-jb=\"5.1.11\" data-lemma=\"तद्भाव इति\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_31\">तद्भाव</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_32\">इति</span></span> <span class=\"tk-vy\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_33\">।</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_34\">न</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_35\">केवलमसतः</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_36\">सदुत्पत्तौ</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_37\">साधकाभावः</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_38\">किन्तु</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_39\">बाधकमपीत्याह</span>-</span> <span class=\"tk-prat\" data-jb=\"5.1.11\" data-lemma=\"यद्यभावादिति\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_40\">यद्यभावादिति</span></span> <span class=\"tk-vy\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_41\">।</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_42\">बाधकान्तरमप्याह</span>–</span> <span class=\"tk-prat\" data-jb=\"5.1.11\" data-lemma=\"अभावशब्देति\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_43\">अभावशब्देति</span></span> <span class=\"tk-vy\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_44\">।</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_45\">घटादिकार्ये</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_46\">मृच्छब्दबुद्ध्योरनुवृत्तिदर्शनादिति</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_47\">भावः</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_48\">।</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_49\">असतः</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_50\">सत्कारणत्वनिराकरणमुपसंहरति</span>-</span> <span class=\"tk-prat\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_51\">अत</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_52\">इति</span></span> <span class=\"tk-vy\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_53\">।</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_54\">अनुवृत्तस्य</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_55\">कारणत्वे</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_56\">मृद्घटो</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_57\">दृष्टान्त</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_58\">उक्तः</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_59\">स</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_60\">नोपपद्यत</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_61\">इति</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_62\">विज्ञानवादिशङ्कामनुवदति</span> –</span> <span class=\"tk-prat\" data-jb=\"5.1.11\" data-lemma=\"यदपीति\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_63\">यदपीति</span></span> <span class=\"tk-vy\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_64\">।</span></span> <span class=\"tk-prat\" data-jb=\"5.1.11\" data-lemma=\"निमित्तमिति\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Chandogya:5.1.11:tabhinava_0_65\">निमित्तमिति</span></sp